<!DOCTYPE concept PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA 1.3 Concept//EN" "concept.dtd">
<concept id="t00284">
	<title id="e02133">Master warning mode <image href="../../images/WKIA_040.eps" align="left" placement="inline" outputclass="nolabel" scale="15" id="e02134"/></title>
	<conbody>
		<section>
			<table frame="none" colsep="1" rowsep="1" outputclass="formatc_none" id="e02135">
				<tgroup cols="2" colsep="1" rowsep="1" outputclass="formatc">
					<colspec colnum="1" colname="1" colwidth="50*"/>
					<colspec colnum="2" colname="2" colwidth="50*"/>
					<tbody>
						<row rowsep="0">
							<entry colname="1" colsep="0">
								<fig id="e02136">
									<figgroup>
										<image href="../../images/OOV035112.eps" align="center" height="1.575in" placement="break" id="e02137"/>
									</figgroup>
								</fig>
							</entry>
							<entry/>
						</row>
					</tbody>
				</tgroup>
			</table>
			<p>This mode informs you of the following situations:</p>
			<indexterm>LCD display modes</indexterm>
			<indexterm>master warning mode</indexterm>
			<ul>
				<li>
					<p importance="optional">Driver assistance system malfunction, limitation or radar/camera blockage</p>
				</li>
				<li>
					<p>LED headlamp malfunction</p>
				</li>
				<li>
					<p>Lamp malfunction</p>
				</li>
				<li>
					<p>TPMS failure, low tire pressure, etc.</p>
				</li>
			</ul>
			<p>At this time, the Master Warning icon (<image href="../../images/WKIA_040.eps" align="left" placement="inline" outputclass="nolabel" scale="15"/>) will appear. If the warning situation is solved, the master warning light will be turned off and the Master Warning icon will disappear.</p>
		</section>
	</conbody>
</concept>